## 7. Feature-Level Target State

Observability should become a native execution timeline and OTel-compatible export surface. Data models should include traces, spans, runs, sessions, steps, tool calls, model calls, policy decisions, artifacts, eval results, costs, and incidents. APIs should ingest/query spans and evals. Workers and SDKs should propagate W3C trace context. UI should show waterfall/timeline views and link artifacts/evidence. SLOs and costs should derive from telemetry. Tests should prove trace propagation, runtime linkage, artifact evidence, OTel export, and metric derivation.

